      "side": 1,
      "message": "Please move declarations closer to their point of first use. This will make the code easier to follow, by letting the reader focus on just the most important variables at a given moment.\n\n\"We encourage you to declare them in as local a scope as possible, and as close to the first use as possible.\"\nhttps://google.github.io/styleguide/cppguide.html#Local_Variables\n\nE.g.\n\n    NL80211NestedAttr freq1(1);\n    NL80211NestedAttr freq2(2);\n    // ...\n    freq1.AddAttribute(...);\n    freq2.AddAttribute(...);\n\n\n    NL80211NestedAttr band_2g_freqs(...);\n    NL80211NestedAttr band_5g_freqs(...);\n    band_2g_freqs.AddAttribute(freq1);\n    // ...\n\n\n    NL80211NestedAttr band_2g(1);\n    NL80211NestedAttr band_5g(2);\n    band_2g.AddAttribute(band_2g_freqs);\n    // ...\n\n\n    NL80211NestedAddr band_attr(...);\n    band_attr.AddAttribute(band_2g);\n    // ...\n\n\n    NL80211Packet new_wiphy(...);\n    new_wiphy.AddAttribute(...);",
      "revId": "171e35ef8b0734f95775cb08426fc8f4f8d95ecc",
